ViridianCity_School_Text_TryingToMemorizeNotes::
    .string "I have to have the table by\n"
    .string "Friday.\p"
    .string "I do not have to understand it.\p"
    .string "I have to have it.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadBlackboardCarefully::
    .string "LANGUAGE comes first.\p"
    .string "Everything else in this building\n"
    .string "is taught in it.\p"
    .string "Right.\p"
    .string "Read the board properly.\n"
    .string "It is all on the board.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFirstPage::
    .string "Let us look at the notebook.\p"
    .string "First page.\p"
    .string "There are seventeen kinds.\p"
    .string "Every daemon is one of them, or\n"
    .string "two of them.\p"
    .string "Its kind decides what it can answer\n"
    .string "and what it cannot.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookSecondPage::
    .string "Second page.\p"
    .string "Some kinds land twice as hard.\p"
    .string "LOGIC on CONTENT. FLOW on\n"
    .string "ENTROPY. CORRUPT on GROWTH.\p"
    .string "Learn the table. It does not\n"
    .string "change.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookThirdPage::
    .string "Third page.\p"
    .string "Some kinds cannot reach at all.\p"
    .string "CONTENT cannot touch LATENT.\n"
    .string "Neither can LOGIC.\p"
    .string "Nothing either one does will\n"
    .string "register.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFourthPage::
    .string "Fourth page.\p"
    .string "The eight benchmarks test whether\n"
    .string "you know the table.\p"
    .string "Pass all eight and the REVIEW\n"
    .string "BOARD will see you.\p"
    .string "That is the whole of the path.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_TurnThePage::
    .string "Turn the page?$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_HeyDontLookAtMyNotes::
    .string "GIRL: Hey.\n"
    .string "Those are my notes.$"

@ ---- T-215: 1F LANGUAGE. DRAFT WORDING, awaiting the user's approval.

ViridianCity_School_Text_Placard::
    .string "1F  LANGUAGE\p"
    .string "What a word points at, how words\n"
    .string "come apart, and why their order\l"
    .string "matters.\p"
    .string "Everything else here is taught\n"
    .string "in words, so words come first.\p"
    .string "The syllabus is on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "1F  LANGUAGE\p"
    .string "TOPICS: NAMES, PIECES, ORDER,\n"
    .string "AMBIGUITY, SPELLING.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_TookSyllabus::
    .string "{PLAYER} took a copy of\n"
    .string "the syllabus.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Spelling::
    .string "SPELLING.\p"
    .string "Every word is a SPELL. It is right\n"
    .string "there in the name.\p"
    .string "Say CAT. There.\p"
    .string "A whole cat turned up. The weight\n"
    .string "of it. Where you last saw one.\p"
    .string "I said three letters.\p"
    .string "Tell me that is not magic.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_BoardIntro::
    .string "The board is written up neatly,\n"
    .string "in five parts.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadWhichTopic::
    .string "Which one?$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Names::
    .string "NAMES\p"
    .string "A name is a handle.\p"
    .string "It lets you point at a thing\n"
    .string "without having to carry it.\p"
    .string "Rename a thing and it stays\n"
    .string "exactly what it was.\p"
    .string "Only the handle moved.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Pieces::
    .string "PIECES\p"
    .string "Words come apart.\p"
    .string "UN-READ-ABLE is three pieces.\n"
    .string "Each one means something alone.\p"
    .string "Learn the pieces, and you can read\n"
    .string "words nobody taught you.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Order::
    .string "ORDER\p"
    .string "Same words, different order.\p"
    .string "USER READS DAEMON.\n"
    .string "DAEMON READS USER.\p"
    .string "Nothing was added. Nothing was\n"
    .string "taken away.\p"
    .string "Everything changed.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Ambiguity::
    .string "AMBIGUITY\p"
    .string "One word can carry several\n"
    .string "meanings.\p"
    .string "A BOX holds a daemon.\n"
    .string "A BOX is where you tick a YES.\p"
    .string "The words around it decide\n"
    .string "which one you meant.$"

ViridianCity_School_Text_Spelling_Board::
    .string "SPELLING\p"
    .string "Spelling is a rule for turning\n"
    .string "a sound into marks.\p"
    .string "The rule is old, and full of\n"
    .string "exceptions.\p"
    .string "Nobody is under a spell.\p"
    .string "In the corner, in smaller chalk,\n"
    .string "someone has added: UNDER A SPELL.\p"
    .string "It is underlined twice.$"
